{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52453","headline":"回波乐 九十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兀兀（张改作「营营」）自免身，拟觅妻儿好。\n切迎（张改「巧遇」）打脊使，穷汉每斈{冫号}（项校「年枵」）。\n枉法剥衆生，财是人髓脑。\n报绝还他债，家家惣须到。\n智者星星（项校「惺惺」）行，愚人自缠遶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}